# Performance and Asset Policy

- Prefer self-hosted assets over runtime third-party dependencies.
- Do not add Google Fonts runtime calls after fonts migration.
- Preload only truly critical assets; avoid mass preloads.
- Keep image dimensions explicit in markup to reduce layout shift.
- Use optimized formats (`webp/png`) for theme assets.
- Keep CSS/JS additions focused; avoid large global overrides when module styles are enough.

